<title>UK: Rentokil raised to hold. [CORRECTED 12:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>Rentokil raised to hold. [CORRECTED 12:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Business services group Rentokil Initial Plc was raised to a &quot;hold&quot; from a &quot;sell&quot; at HSBC James Capel (corrects from &quot;cut the stock to sell from hold&quot;), market sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Analysts at Capel were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>The stock was down 1/2p at 466-1/2 by 1202 GMT in active trade of 3.8 million shares. Rentokil shares yesterday hit an intraday record of 469p.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
